@startuml phase5-ivi-components
' Phase 5 module map for IVI_ECU (R4, R16, R17) — see ivi-ecu-hld.md §3/§4.
' Arrows read "depends on". The graph is acyclic and one-way: nothing below
' :app knows an Android type, and nothing knows the front end.

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

package "IVI_ECU (Gradle multi-project 'v2x-ivi')" {

  component ":contract\n<size:10>pure Kotlin/JVM — zero Android</size>" as CONTRACT
  note right of CONTRACT
    com.hackathon.v2x.ivi.model
    R4Message / R4WarningEvent / R4StateMessage
    R3Snapshot · SceneGeometry · VehiclePosition
    R4Json (classDiscriminator="type", ignoreUnknownKeys)
    resources: contracts/samples/*.json (byte-synced)
  end note

  component ":serializer\n<size:10>pure Kotlin/JVM</size>" as SER
  note right of SER
    com.hackathon.v2x.ivi.serializer
    R4Decoder (interface) · R4Deserializer (impl)
    buffer slice → BOM/UTF-8 → decode → R4DecodeResult
    pure: returns typed results, never throws, never logs
  end note

  component ":observer\n<size:10>pure Kotlin/JVM</size>" as OBS
  note right of OBS
    com.hackathon.v2x.ivi.observer
    R4DatagramSource (seam) · JdkDatagramSource
    R4SocketObserver — receive loop, back-off, bind state
    events: SharedFlow<R4Event> (DROP_OLDEST)
    R4Logger (seam, implemented by :app)
  end note

  component ":app\n<size:10>Android APK — the only Android module</size>" as APP
  note right of APP
    IviApplication · IviGraph · MainActivity
    service/R4ListenerService (foreground host)
    data/R4Repository — last warning, last state, link state
    warning/WarningClassifier — business rules
    ui/WarningViewModel · ui/MainViewModel
    ui/screen/MainScreen · ui/view/* (IviWarningViewSeam)
    debug source set: DevInjectorReceiver (I3)
  end note

  component ":r4-simulator\n<size:10>Kotlin/JVM CLI + OCI image</size>" as SIM
  note left of SIM
    com.hackathon.v2x.ivi.sim
    scenario runner over the frozen samples
    host mode (args) · in-Room mode (env)
    validates every payload through R4Json before send
  end note
}

cloud "CarSky Ethernet Bridge (R6)\n10.99.0.0/24" as NET

SER --> CONTRACT : models + R4Json
OBS --> SER : R4Decoder
APP --> OBS : events, link state
APP ..> SER : R4DecodeResult types
APP ..> CONTRACT : models for the UI
SIM --> CONTRACT : same models, same Json

SIM --> NET : UDP port 47300
NET --> OBS : datagram

legend right
  |= Layer (MVC) |= Where |
  | Data | :contract models · :app data/R4Repository |
  | Business logic | :serializer · :observer · :app warning/ · SceneCoordinateMapper |
  | UI logic | :app ui/WarningViewModel · ui/MainViewModel |
  | UI | :app ui/screen · ui/view behind IviWarningViewSeam |
endlegend

@enduml
